# Port of 19 PrimeNumberTheoremAnd files (https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd, commit
# 650d31264be65f4cd6e70c45d8b25d86d482a761, Lean v4.33.1) to the pilot's toolchain (Lean v4.35.0-rc3, Mathlib
# 0f64d30a9a4593b3ae50375b960a5cf7f0845606). PrimeNumberTheoremAnd is by its contributors and released under
# the Apache License 2.0; build.sh copies its LICENSE next to the patched files. Applied by build.sh with
# `patch -p1` in upstream/. Files not listed here are used unchanged.
#
# Changes, all forced by Mathlib API drift between the two versions:
# - EulerMaclaurin: import Mathlib.MeasureTheory.Function.Floor directly (AbelSummation no longer re-exports it).
# - MellinCalculus: Integrable.piecewise now takes a NullMeasurableSet; restate a product-set goal with `change`.
# - Wiener: give two binders their type ℝ, which elaboration no longer infers from the filter.
# - Consequences: Nat.primeFactorsList_count_eq is no longer a simp lemma; pass it to norm_num.
# - StrongPNT: Finset.prod_le_prod → prod_le_prod₀ (renamed); logDeriv_prod → logDeriv_fun_prod (the pointwise
#   form got the new name).
